{"version":1,"content":"<p>據美國國家公共廣播電台（NPR）10月26日報道，颶風預報員正越來越多地藉助人工智能進行預測，並稱這項技術正在迅速改變整個領域。本月大西洋颶風季首個颶風生成時，一個人工智能模型的路徑預測就壓過了傳統模型。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583940.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T14:41:07.685121+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":107,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T14:09:41+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T14:38:11.022268+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T14:38:11.022268+00:00","content_hash":"6d1cbf73fbd3eba6a75c776921ab667e6a846bc0058a207d1944b8e2b9212dfe","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}